IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ccc-core`
IMPORT `ccc11-definitions`

-- ccc11-punishment.l4 -- Part VIII.1, sections 320.19 to 320.22 (punishment; aggravating circumstances) and 320.26 (earlier and subsequent offences) of the Criminal Code (Canada),
-- R.S.C., 1985, c. C-46. LAYER 1: the law, objectively, from the text alone. Source: a plain-text rendering, made by a converter script, of the Justice Laws Website consolidation
-- (current to 2026-09-30); it is not the official text, and nothing here is claimed verified against the official text.
-- A punishment is the core's `Punishment` (ONE limb: one mode of proceeding), so a section with an indictable limb and a summary limb is answered with two. The minimum punishment
-- depends on the occasion (first, second, subsequent); section 320.26 says how the occasion is counted for sentences under 320.14(1) and 320.15(1) only (fork F3 in NOTES.md).
-- Amounts in dollars; periods in the text's units (`Length of time`); an offence is named by its place in the Code (`Provision of the Code`: section as a decimal, subsection as a string).
-- A function answers a core value (`Punishment`, `Fine`, ...) where the text always answers, and a MAYBE of it where the text answers only for some cases: NOTHING is "not covered".

§ `Part VIII.1 -- sections 320.19 to 320.21: punishment`

DECLARE `s 320.19 occasion` IS ONE OF
    `s 320.19 a first offence`
    `s 320.19 a second offence`
    `s 320.19 a subsequent offence`

-- The punishment of the offence charged, composed from the sections above for ONE offence named by its place in the Code (R1). The seam functions the other parts ask for
-- (PLAN.md section 6: "the punishment the offence charged is liable to", "the class of the offence charged") are this one and the class function below.
-- An offence these sections do not punish is NOT COVERED (NOTHING). The blood alcohol concentration is read only for a first offence under paragraph 320.14(1)(b).
-- src:6262 | Punishment
-- src:6263 | 320.19 (1) Every person who commits an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1) is guilty of
-- src:6264 | (a) an indictable offence and liable to imprisonment for a term of not more than 10 years and to a minimum punishment of,
-- src:6265 | (i) for a first offence, a fine of $1,000,
-- src:6266 | (ii) for a second offence, imprisonment for a term of 30 days, and
-- src:6267 | (iii) for each subsequent offence, imprisonment for a term of 120 days; or
-- src:6268 | (b) an offence punishable on summary conviction and liable to a fine of not more than $5,000 or to imprisonment for a term of not more than two years less a day, or to both, and to a minimum punishment of,
-- src:6269 | (i) for a first offence, a fine of $1,000,
-- src:6270 | (ii) for a second offence, imprisonment for a term of 30 days, and
-- src:6271 | (iii) for each subsequent offence, imprisonment for a term of 120 days.
-- src:6272 | Summary conviction
-- src:6273 | (2) Everyone who commits an offence under subsection 320.14(4) is liable on summary conviction to a fine of not more than $1,000.
-- src:6274 | Minimum fines for high blood alcohol concentrations
-- src:6275 | (3) Despite subparagraphs (1)(a)(i) and (b)(i), every person who commits an offence under paragraph 320.14(1)(b) is liable, for a first offence, to
-- src:6276 | (a) a fine of not less than $1,500, if the person’s blood alcohol concentration is equal to or exceeds 120 mg of alcohol in 100 mL of blood but is less than 160 mg of alcohol in 100 mL of blood; and
-- src:6277 | (b) a fine of not less than $2,000, if the person’s blood alcohol concentration is equal to or exceeds 160 mg of alcohol in 100 mL of blood.
-- src:6278 | Minimum fine — subsection 320.15(1)
-- src:6279 | (4) Despite subparagraphs (1)(a)(i) and (b)(i), every person who commits an offence under subsection 320.15(1) is liable, for a first offence, to a fine of not less than $2,000.
-- src:6280 | Punishment — dangerous operation and other offences
-- src:6281 | (5) Every person who commits an offence under subsection 320.13(1) or 320.16(1), section 320.17 or subsection 320.18(1) is guilty of
-- src:6282 | (a) an indictable offence and liable to imprisonment for a term of not more than 10 years; or
-- src:6283 | (b) an offence punishable on summary conviction.
-- src:6284 | Punishment in case of bodily harm
-- src:6285 | 320.2 Every person who commits an offence under subsection 320.13(2), 320.14(2), 320.15(2) or 320.16(2) is guilty of
-- src:6286 | (a) an indictable offence and liable to imprisonment for a term of not more than 14 years and to a minimum punishment of,
-- src:6287 | (i) for a first offence, a fine of $1,000,
-- src:6288 | (ii) for a second offence, imprisonment for a term of 30 days, and
-- src:6289 | (iii) for each subsequent offence, imprisonment for a term of 120 days; or
-- src:6290 | (b) an offence punishable on summary conviction and liable to a fine of not more than $5,000 or to imprisonment for a term of not more than two years less a day, or to both, and to the minimum punishments set out in subparagraphs (a)(i) to (iii).
-- src:6291 | Punishment in case of death
-- src:6292 | 320.21 Everyone who commits an offence under subsection 320.13(3), 320.14(3), 320.15(3) or 320.16(3) is liable on conviction on indictment to imprisonment for life and to a minimum punishment of,
-- src:6293 | (a) for a first offence, a fine of $1,000;
-- src:6294 | (b) for a second offence, imprisonment for a term of 30 days; and
-- src:6295 | (c) for each subsequent offence, imprisonment for a term of 120 days.
@ref Criminal Code s 320.19 (src:6262-6295)
GIVEN offence IS A `Provision of the Code`
      mode IS A `Mode of proceeding`
      occasion IS A `s 320.19 occasion`
      `the person’s blood alcohol concentration, in mg of alcohol in 100 mL of blood` IS A NUMBER
      `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A Punishment
GIVETH A MAYBE Punishment
`s 320.19 the punishment the offence is liable to` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF sec EQUALS 320.14 AND (sub EQUALS "(1)" OR sub EQUALS "(1)(a)" OR sub EQUALS "(1)(b)" OR sub EQUALS "(1)(c)" OR sub EQUALS "(1)(d)") THEN JUST raisedBy3
        IF sec EQUALS 320.15 AND sub EQUALS "(1)" THEN JUST raisedBy4
        IF sec EQUALS 320.14 AND sub EQUALS "(4)" THEN `s 320.19(2) the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.14(4)` mode
        IF (sec EQUALS 320.13 AND sub EQUALS "(1)") OR (sec EQUALS 320.16 AND sub EQUALS "(1)") OR (sec EQUALS 320.17 AND sub EQUALS "") OR (sec EQUALS 320.18 AND sub EQUALS "(1)")
            THEN JUST (`s 320.19(5) the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.13(1) or 320.16(1), section 320.17 or subsection 320.18(1)` mode `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`)
        IF (sec EQUALS 320.13 OR sec EQUALS 320.14 OR sec EQUALS 320.15 OR sec EQUALS 320.16) AND sub EQUALS "(2)"
            THEN JUST (`s 320.2 the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.13(2), 320.14(2), 320.15(2) or 320.16(2)` mode occasion)
        IF (sec EQUALS 320.13 OR sec EQUALS 320.14 OR sec EQUALS 320.15 OR sec EQUALS 320.16) AND sub EQUALS "(3)"
            THEN `s 320.21 the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.13(3), 320.14(3), 320.15(3) or 320.16(3)` mode occasion
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): sections 320.19 to 320.21 do not punish this offence
    WHERE
        sec MEANS offence's `section`
        sub MEANS offence's `subsection`
        base MEANS `s 320.19(1) the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` mode occasion
        isFirst MEANS occasion EQUALS `s 320.19 a first offence`
        raisedBy3 MEANS
            IF isFirst AND sub EQUALS "(1)(b)"
            THEN CONSIDER `s 320.19(3) the minimum fine for a first offence under paragraph 320.14(1)(b)` `the person’s blood alcohol concentration, in mg of alcohol in 100 mL of blood`
                 WHEN JUST f THEN `s 320.19(3) and (4) the punishment with its minimum fine replaced by` base f
                 WHEN NOTHING THEN base
            ELSE base
        raisedBy4 MEANS
            CONSIDER `s 320.19(4) the minimum fine for a first offence under subsection 320.15(1)` occasion
            WHEN JUST f THEN `s 320.19(3) and (4) the punishment with its minimum fine replaced by` base f
            WHEN NOTHING THEN base

-- The class of the offence, as the punishing section states it: "is guilty of (a) an indictable offence ... or (b) an offence punishable on summary conviction" (both: 320.19(1), (5), 320.2);
-- "is liable on summary conviction" only (320.19(2)); "is liable on conviction on indictment" only (320.21). The core words the third class from the Act's own phrase.
@ref Criminal Code s 320.19 (src:6262-6295)
GIVEN offence IS A `Provision of the Code`
GIVETH A MAYBE `Class of offence`
`s 320.19 the class of the offence` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (sec EQUALS 320.14 AND (sub EQUALS "(1)" OR sub EQUALS "(1)(a)" OR sub EQUALS "(1)(b)" OR sub EQUALS "(1)(c)" OR sub EQUALS "(1)(d)")) OR (sec EQUALS 320.15 AND sub EQUALS "(1)")
            THEN JUST `an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`
        IF sec EQUALS 320.14 AND sub EQUALS "(4)" THEN JUST `an offence punishable on summary conviction`
        IF (sec EQUALS 320.13 AND sub EQUALS "(1)") OR (sec EQUALS 320.16 AND sub EQUALS "(1)") OR (sec EQUALS 320.17 AND sub EQUALS "") OR (sec EQUALS 320.18 AND sub EQUALS "(1)")
            THEN JUST `an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`
        IF (sec EQUALS 320.13 OR sec EQUALS 320.14 OR sec EQUALS 320.15 OR sec EQUALS 320.16) AND sub EQUALS "(2)"
            THEN JUST `an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`
        IF (sec EQUALS 320.13 OR sec EQUALS 320.14 OR sec EQUALS 320.15 OR sec EQUALS 320.16) AND sub EQUALS "(3)"
            THEN JUST `an indictable offence`
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): sections 320.19 to 320.21 do not state the class of this offence
    WHERE
        sec MEANS offence's `section`
        sub MEANS offence's `subsection`


-- "Despite subparagraphs (1)(a)(i) and (b)(i)": subsections (3) and (4) replace the minimum fine of a FIRST offence in both limbs. This helper rebuilds the limb with that fine.
@ref Criminal Code s 320.19(3) and (4) (src:6274-6279)
GIVEN limb IS A Punishment
      fine IS A Fine
GIVETH A Punishment
`s 320.19(3) and (4) the punishment with its minimum fine replaced by` MEANS
    Punishment WITH
        `mode` IS limb's `mode`
        `maximum imprisonment` IS limb's `maximum imprisonment`
        `minimum imprisonment` IS limb's `minimum imprisonment`
        `maximum fine` IS limb's `maximum fine`
        `minimum fine` IS fine

-- 320.19(1): offences under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1). The minimum punishment is (i) for a first offence a fine of $1,000, (ii) for a second offence imprisonment for 30 days,
-- (iii) for each subsequent offence imprisonment for 120 days; the same in both limbs.
@ref Criminal Code s 320.19(1) (src:6262-6271)
GIVEN occasion IS A `s 320.19 occasion`
GIVETH A Fine
`s 320.19(1)(a)(i) the minimum fine on indictment` MEANS
    CONSIDER occasion
    WHEN `s 320.19 a first offence` THEN `a fine of` 1000
    WHEN `s 320.19 a second offence` THEN `no fine is stated`   -- the limb states no minimum fine for a second offence: its minimum is imprisonment ((ii))
    WHEN `s 320.19 a subsequent offence` THEN `no fine is stated`   -- the limb states no minimum fine for a subsequent offence: its minimum is imprisonment ((iii))

@ref Criminal Code s 320.19(1)(a)(ii) and (iii) (src:6266-6267)
GIVEN occasion IS A `s 320.19 occasion`
GIVETH AN Imprisonment
`s 320.19(1)(a)(ii) and (iii) the minimum imprisonment on indictment` MEANS
    CONSIDER occasion
    WHEN `s 320.19 a first offence` THEN `no imprisonment is stated`   -- the limb states no minimum imprisonment for a first offence: its minimum is a fine ((i))
    WHEN `s 320.19 a second offence` THEN `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 0, 30, FALSE)
    WHEN `s 320.19 a subsequent offence` THEN `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 0, 120, FALSE)

@ref Criminal Code s 320.19(1)(a) (src:6264-6267)
GIVEN occasion IS A `s 320.19 occasion`
GIVETH A Punishment
`s 320.19(1)(a) the punishment on indictment for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` MEANS
    Punishment WITH
        `mode` IS `by indictment`
        `maximum imprisonment` IS `imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`
        `minimum imprisonment` IS `s 320.19(1)(a)(ii) and (iii) the minimum imprisonment on indictment` occasion
        `maximum fine` IS `no fine is stated`
        `minimum fine` IS `s 320.19(1)(a)(i) the minimum fine on indictment` occasion

@ref Criminal Code s 320.19(1)(b)(i) (src:6269)
GIVEN occasion IS A `s 320.19 occasion`
GIVETH A Fine
`s 320.19(1)(b)(i) the minimum fine on summary conviction` MEANS
    CONSIDER occasion
    WHEN `s 320.19 a first offence` THEN `a fine of` 1000
    WHEN `s 320.19 a second offence` THEN `no fine is stated`   -- the limb states no minimum fine for a second offence: its minimum is imprisonment ((ii))
    WHEN `s 320.19 a subsequent offence` THEN `no fine is stated`   -- the limb states no minimum fine for a subsequent offence: its minimum is imprisonment ((iii))

@ref Criminal Code s 320.19(1)(b)(ii) and (iii) (src:6270-6271)
GIVEN occasion IS A `s 320.19 occasion`
GIVETH AN Imprisonment
`s 320.19(1)(b)(ii) and (iii) the minimum imprisonment on summary conviction` MEANS
    CONSIDER occasion
    WHEN `s 320.19 a first offence` THEN `no imprisonment is stated`   -- the limb states no minimum imprisonment for a first offence: its minimum is a fine ((i))
    WHEN `s 320.19 a second offence` THEN `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 0, 30, FALSE)
    WHEN `s 320.19 a subsequent offence` THEN `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 0, 120, FALSE)

@ref Criminal Code s 320.19(1)(b) (src:6268-6271)
GIVEN occasion IS A `s 320.19 occasion`
GIVETH A Punishment
`s 320.19(1)(b) the punishment on summary conviction for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` MEANS
    Punishment WITH
        `mode` IS `on summary conviction`
        `maximum imprisonment` IS `imprisonment for a term of` `two years less a day`
        `minimum imprisonment` IS `s 320.19(1)(b)(ii) and (iii) the minimum imprisonment on summary conviction` occasion
        `maximum fine` IS `a fine of` 5000
        `minimum fine` IS `s 320.19(1)(b)(i) the minimum fine on summary conviction` occasion

@ref Criminal Code s 320.19(1) (src:6262-6271)
GIVEN mode IS A `Mode of proceeding`
      occasion IS A `s 320.19 occasion`
GIVETH A Punishment
`s 320.19(1) the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` MEANS
    CONSIDER mode
    WHEN `by indictment` THEN `s 320.19(1)(a) the punishment on indictment for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` occasion
    WHEN `on summary conviction` THEN `s 320.19(1)(b) the punishment on summary conviction for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` occasion

-- 320.19(2): the offence under subsection 320.14(4) is punishable on summary conviction only: a fine of not more than $1,000 and no imprisonment is stated.
@ref Criminal Code s 320.19(2) (src:6272-6273)
GIVEN mode IS A `Mode of proceeding`
GIVETH A MAYBE Punishment
`s 320.19(2) the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.14(4)` MEANS
    CONSIDER mode
    WHEN `on summary conviction` THEN JUST (Punishment WITH
        `mode` IS `on summary conviction`
        `maximum imprisonment` IS `no imprisonment is stated`
        `minimum imprisonment` IS `no imprisonment is stated`
        `maximum fine` IS `a fine of` 1000
        `minimum fine` IS `no fine is stated`)
    WHEN `by indictment` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the subsection states only a summary conviction limb, "is liable on summary conviction to a fine of not more than $1,000"

-- 320.19(3): "Despite subparagraphs (1)(a)(i) and (b)(i)", for a FIRST offence under paragraph 320.14(1)(b): a fine of not less than $1,500 if the blood alcohol concentration is at least 120 and
-- below 160 mg in 100 mL; not less than $2,000 if 160 or more. Below 120 the subsection says nothing (the $1,000 of (1) stands): NOTHING, a case outside the limit the text states.
@ref Criminal Code s 320.19(3) (src:6274-6277)
GIVEN `the person’s blood alcohol concentration, in mg of alcohol in 100 mL of blood` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE Fine
`s 320.19(3) the minimum fine for a first offence under paragraph 320.14(1)(b)` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the person’s blood alcohol concentration, in mg of alcohol in 100 mL of blood` AT LEAST 160 THEN JUST (`a fine of` 2000)
        IF `the person’s blood alcohol concentration, in mg of alcohol in 100 mL of blood` AT LEAST 120 THEN JUST (`a fine of` 1500)
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a fine of not less than $1,500, if the person’s blood alcohol concentration is equal to or exceeds 120 mg of alcohol in 100 mL of blood"

-- 320.19(4): "Despite ... (1)(a)(i) and (b)(i)", for a first offence under subsection 320.15(1): a fine of not less than $2,000.
@ref Criminal Code s 320.19(4) (src:6278-6279)
GIVEN occasion IS A `s 320.19 occasion`
GIVETH A MAYBE Fine
`s 320.19(4) the minimum fine for a first offence under subsection 320.15(1)` MEANS
    CONSIDER occasion
    WHEN `s 320.19 a first offence` THEN JUST (`a fine of` 2000)
    WHEN `s 320.19 a second offence` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "for a first offence, to a fine of not less than $2,000"
    WHEN `s 320.19 a subsequent offence` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "for a first offence, to a fine of not less than $2,000"

-- 320.19(5): offences under 320.13(1), 320.16(1), 320.17 and 320.18(1): (a) indictable, imprisonment of not more than 10 years; (b) an offence punishable on summary conviction, for which the
-- text states no penalty: the general penalty of section 787(1) (Part XXVII, ccc29) is an INPUT, as PLAN.md section 6 (seam) names it.
@ref Criminal Code s 320.19(5) (src:6280-6283)
GIVEN mode IS A `Mode of proceeding`
      `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A Punishment
GIVETH A Punishment
`s 320.19(5) the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.13(1) or 320.16(1), section 320.17 or subsection 320.18(1)` MEANS
    CONSIDER mode
    WHEN `by indictment` THEN Punishment WITH
        `mode` IS `by indictment`
        `maximum imprisonment` IS `imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`
        `minimum imprisonment` IS `no imprisonment is stated`
        `maximum fine` IS `no fine is stated`
        `minimum fine` IS `no fine is stated`
    WHEN `on summary conviction` THEN `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`

-- 320.2 (bodily harm): (a) indictable, imprisonment of not more than 14 years and the minimum punishments (i) to (iii); (b) summary conviction: a fine of not more than $5,000 or
-- imprisonment of not more than two years less a day, or both, and "the minimum punishments set out in subparagraphs (a)(i) to (iii)".
@ref Criminal Code s 320.2 (src:6284-6290)
GIVEN occasion IS A `s 320.19 occasion`
GIVETH A Punishment
`s 320.2(a) the punishment on indictment for an offence under subsection 320.13(2), 320.14(2), 320.15(2) or 320.16(2)` MEANS
    Punishment WITH
        `mode` IS `by indictment`
        `maximum imprisonment` IS `imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`
        `minimum imprisonment` IS `s 320.2(a)(ii) and (iii) the minimum imprisonment` occasion
        `maximum fine` IS `no fine is stated`
        `minimum fine` IS `s 320.2(a)(i) the minimum fine` occasion

@ref Criminal Code s 320.2(a)(i) (src:6287)
GIVEN occasion IS A `s 320.19 occasion`
GIVETH A Fine
`s 320.2(a)(i) the minimum fine` MEANS
    CONSIDER occasion
    WHEN `s 320.19 a first offence` THEN `a fine of` 1000
    WHEN `s 320.19 a second offence` THEN `no fine is stated`   -- the limb states no minimum fine for a second offence: its minimum is imprisonment ((ii))
    WHEN `s 320.19 a subsequent offence` THEN `no fine is stated`   -- the limb states no minimum fine for a subsequent offence: its minimum is imprisonment ((iii))

@ref Criminal Code s 320.2(a)(ii) and (iii) (src:6288-6289)
GIVEN occasion IS A `s 320.19 occasion`
GIVETH AN Imprisonment
`s 320.2(a)(ii) and (iii) the minimum imprisonment` MEANS
    CONSIDER occasion
    WHEN `s 320.19 a first offence` THEN `no imprisonment is stated`   -- the limb states no minimum imprisonment for a first offence: its minimum is a fine ((i))
    WHEN `s 320.19 a second offence` THEN `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 0, 30, FALSE)
    WHEN `s 320.19 a subsequent offence` THEN `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 0, 120, FALSE)

@ref Criminal Code s 320.2(b) (src:6290)
GIVEN occasion IS A `s 320.19 occasion`
GIVETH A Punishment
`s 320.2(b) the punishment on summary conviction for an offence under subsection 320.13(2), 320.14(2), 320.15(2) or 320.16(2)` MEANS
    Punishment WITH
        `mode` IS `on summary conviction`
        `maximum imprisonment` IS `imprisonment for a term of` `two years less a day`
        `minimum imprisonment` IS `s 320.2(a)(ii) and (iii) the minimum imprisonment` occasion
        `maximum fine` IS `a fine of` 5000
        `minimum fine` IS `s 320.2(a)(i) the minimum fine` occasion

@ref Criminal Code s 320.2 (src:6284-6290)
GIVEN mode IS A `Mode of proceeding`
      occasion IS A `s 320.19 occasion`
GIVETH A Punishment
`s 320.2 the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.13(2), 320.14(2), 320.15(2) or 320.16(2)` MEANS
    CONSIDER mode
    WHEN `by indictment` THEN `s 320.2(a) the punishment on indictment for an offence under subsection 320.13(2), 320.14(2), 320.15(2) or 320.16(2)` occasion
    WHEN `on summary conviction` THEN `s 320.2(b) the punishment on summary conviction for an offence under subsection 320.13(2), 320.14(2), 320.15(2) or 320.16(2)` occasion

-- 320.21 (death): "liable on conviction on indictment to imprisonment for life and to a minimum punishment of (a) first offence a fine of $1,000; (b) second, 30 days; (c) subsequent, 120 days".
-- Only an indictment limb is stated: the summary mode is NOT covered.
@ref Criminal Code s 320.21 (src:6291-6295)
GIVEN mode IS A `Mode of proceeding`
      occasion IS A `s 320.19 occasion`
GIVETH A MAYBE Punishment
`s 320.21 the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.13(3), 320.14(3), 320.15(3) or 320.16(3)` MEANS
    CONSIDER mode
    WHEN `on summary conviction` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "is liable on conviction on indictment to imprisonment for life"
    WHEN `by indictment` THEN JUST (Punishment WITH
        `mode` IS `by indictment`
        `maximum imprisonment` IS `imprisonment for life`
        `minimum imprisonment` IS CONSIDER occasion
            WHEN `s 320.19 a first offence` THEN `no imprisonment is stated`
            WHEN `s 320.19 a second offence` THEN `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 0, 30, FALSE)
            WHEN `s 320.19 a subsequent offence` THEN `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 0, 120, FALSE)
        `maximum fine` IS `no fine is stated`
        `minimum fine` IS CONSIDER occasion
            WHEN `s 320.19 a first offence` THEN `a fine of` 1000
            WHEN `s 320.19 a second offence` THEN `no fine is stated`
            WHEN `s 320.19 a subsequent offence` THEN `no fine is stated`)

§ `Part VIII.1 -- section 320.22: aggravating circumstances for sentencing purposes`

-- "A court imposing a sentence for an offence under any of sections 320.13 to 320.18 shall consider, in addition to any other aggravating circumstances, the following: (a) to (g)".
-- The scope is tested by section number (R1): 320.13 to 320.18 take in 320.14, 320.15, 320.16, 320.17 (decimals sort in the Code's order); 320.19 and 320.2 are outside. Outside it the
-- duty is not stated (a scope limit with no "only": ruling of 2026-11-05 (c): NOTHING).
-- src:6296 | Aggravating circumstances for sentencing purposes
-- src:6297 | 320.22 A court imposing a sentence for an offence under any of sections 320.13 to 320.18 shall consider, in addition to any other aggravating circumstances, the following:
-- src:6298 | (a) the commission of the offence resulted in bodily harm to, or the death of, more than one person;
-- src:6299 | (b) the offender was operating a motor vehicle in a race with at least one other motor vehicle or in a contest of speed, on a street, road or highway or in another public place;
-- src:6300 | (c) a person under the age of 16 years was a passenger in the conveyance operated by the offender;
-- src:6301 | (d) the offender was being remunerated for operating the conveyance;
-- src:6302 | (e) the offender’s blood alcohol concentration at the time of committing the offence was equal to or exceeded 120 mg of alcohol in 100 mL of blood;
-- src:6303 | (f) the offender was operating a large motor vehicle; and
-- src:6304 | (g) the offender was not permitted, under a federal or provincial Act, to operate the conveyance.
@ref Criminal Code s 320.22 (src:6296-6304)
GIVEN offence IS A `Provision of the Code`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 320.22 the sentence is for an offence under any of sections 320.13 to 320.18` MEANS
    IF offence's `section` AT LEAST 320.13 AND offence's `section` AT MOST 320.18
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "A court imposing a sentence for an offence under any of sections 320.13 to 320.18 shall consider"

-- Each paragraph: the court shall consider the circumstance when it is present; the list is not closed ("in addition to any other aggravating circumstances"), but the question of each
-- paragraph is whether THAT circumstance is present: when it is not, the paragraph requires nothing (JUST FALSE, the paragraph's own question; fork F9 in NOTES.md).
@ref Criminal Code s 320.22(a) (src:6298)
